Detonate	TYPE:Psionic	SCHOOL:Psychokenesis	COMPS:Au, Ma, Vi	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Medium	TARGETAREA:One object 10 ft. cubed or smaller, one mindless construct or one mindless undead	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates and Reflex half	SPELLRES:Yes	CLASSES:Psion,Wilder=4	DESC:PP:11 Explode one object, mindless construct or mindless undead. Target takes 7d6 damage. Creatures and held magical items get a Fortitude save to avoid. Creatures and objects within 10 feet take the same damage, but not more than twice the target's hit points, and may save for half damage. Augment: For every additional power points you spend, this power's damage increases by 1d6 points. For each extra two dice of damage, this power's save DC (for both saves) increases by 1.	SOURCELONG:Dark Sun Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:dscs	SOURCEPAGE:p.182	SOURCEWEB:http://www.wizards.com/welcome.asp	SOURCEDATE:2003-09
