Shroud of Darkness	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Necromancy	COMPS:V, S, M, F	CASTTIME:1 round	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Cloak touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) minutes [D]	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless,object)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless,object)	SOURCELONG:Dark Sun Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:dscs	SOURCEPAGE:p.167	SOURCEWEB:http://www.wizards.com/welcome.asp	SOURCEDATE:2003-09
Protection from Time	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Abjuration	COMPS:V, S, M, XP	CASTTIME:1 minute	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One creature or object touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL/2) months	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmeless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCELONG:Dark Sun Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:dscs	SOURCEPAGE:p.164	SOURCEWEB:http://www.wizards.com/welcome.asp	SOURCEDATE:2003-09
Tempest	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Evocation	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 round	RANGE:Medium	TARGETAREA:20-ft.-radius spread	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Reflex negates	SPELLRES:Yes	SOURCELONG:Dark Sun Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:dscs	SOURCEPAGE:p.171	SOURCEWEB:http://www.wizards.com/welcome.asp	SOURCEDATE:2003-09
Pact of Darkness	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Necromancy	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 minute	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:One summoned shadow giant	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	SOURCELONG:Dark Sun Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:dscs	SOURCEPAGE:p.162	SOURCEWEB:http://www.wizards.com/welcome.asp	SOURCEDATE:2003-09
Firewater	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:(CASTERLEVEL) gallons of water	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) hours	SAVEINFO:None; see text	SPELLRES:No	SOURCELONG:Dark Sun Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:dscs	SOURCEPAGE:p.155	SOURCEWEB:http://www.wizards.com/welcome.asp	SOURCEDATE:2003-09
